Dialogue: 9,0:00:01.52,0:00:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sirotan
Dialogue: 9,0:00:05.99,0:00:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorun ne?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:07.99,0:00:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Kestirmenin daha rahat bir yolu olmalı.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:12.12,0:00:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Uyuma araştırması.\N
Dialogue: 9,0:00:14.45,0:00:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hadi yapalım.\N
Dialogue: 9,0:00:15.68,0:00:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Birçok şeyi deneyelim.\N
Dialogue: 9,0:00:18.59,0:00:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Normal şekilde uyusak olmaz mı?\N
Dialogue: 9,0:00:21.10,0:00:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Bu nasıl?\N
Dialogue: 9,0:00:23.29,0:00:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Bu da fena değil.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:25.72,0:00:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Bu da güzel hissettiriyor.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:29.68,0:00:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yorucu gözüküyor.\N
Dialogue: 9,0:00:36.57,0:00:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Bu harika.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:38.55,0:00:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mışıl mışıl
Dialogue: 9,0:00:40.22,0:00:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Çok rahat hissettiriyor.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:44.96,0:00:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Bu kestirme sayılır mı ki?
Dialogue: 9,0:00:48.63,0:00:50.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Çoktan gece oldu.
Dialogue: 9,0:00:50.20,0:00:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ama öğlen uyumaya başladık
Dialogue: 9,0:00:53.98,0:00:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Kestirmek ne güzel şey.
